    utas:description "This project investigates geothermal heat flow, lithosphere dynamics, and ice-sheet evolution in East Antarctica. Using geological and geophysical data, plate reconstructions, and mantle flow models, it will constrain heat-flow variability and geodynamic evolution of the Cook Glacier area."^^xsd:string ;
