<https://example.org/utas-research/supervisor/doctor-michelle-kilpatrick-660ba23b2a03> a utas:Supervisor ;
    rdfs:label "Doctor Michelle Kilpatrick"@en ;
    utas:bio "As a public health and mental health services researcher, Dr Kilpatrick's work has focussed on bridging the gap between research evidence and real-world policy and practice. She has worked closely with government, health services, and peak bodies to evaluate complex strategies, design scalable interventions, and build capacity across the health workforce. Her work spans preventive health, mental health service reform, and clinician training, with a focus on ensuring policy decisions are evidence-informed and outcomes-driven."^^xsd:string ;
