<https://example.org/utas-research/supervisor/professor-melissa-hart-f1174f264d78> a utas:Supervisor ;
    rdfs:label "Professor Melissa Hart"@en ;
    utas:bio "Professor Melissa Hart leads training and development in the ARC Centre of Excellence for 21st Century Weather. She has led and developed national, cross-institutional researcher development programs in two previous Centres of Excellence. Her leadership has been recognized via a UNSW Vice-Chancellors Award for higher degree research leadership and has been profiled in the Higher Education Supplement of The Australian newspaper. Internationally, she is the co-chair of the World Climate Research Programme training academy."^^xsd:string ;
